#: ../../content/applications/studio/pdf_reports.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Paper format`: to define the default paper size of reports. You "
"can select :guilabel:`A4` (21 cm x 29.7 cm), :guilabel:`US Letter` (21.59 cm "
